  "scope": "A separate extension completes actual RVQ from CDUTRIG, CD*TR*G, transformed VLOAD/pendingRVQ and SMCDURES return boundaries. It qualifies every one of32768 ordinary saved FCADR words at each of four source origins, including fixed banks0/1: unlike indirect GOTO, RVQ explicitly enters GOTO+4 and skips erasable classification. It restores EB from BANKSET, records POLISH, derives FB/BB/BANKSET/LOC/INTBIT15, normalizes the raw L register exactly as source dispatch does, and returns at NEWOPS06037. The older immutable permanent-interface proof remains scoped to its >=040000 saved-return domain. Pending RVQ retains canonical ownership; the completed SMCDURES EDOP0 boundary permits the external source Executive check before this call."
